data: {"id": "ceeacb1308ba4f3b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1413", "run_id": "ceeacb1308ba4f3b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集事实\n\n根据 `kubectl describe`、`get yaml`、`previous_logs` 以及基线采集的 ES/Logs 结果，证实以下事实：\n\n1.  **当前状态**：Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，已重启 **13 次**。\n2.  **崩溃原因 (Exit Code 78)**：\n    *   容器 `app` 的最后状态 (`Last State`) 退出码为 **78**，原因为 `Error`。\n    *   Pod 定义中的 `Command` 逻辑：尝试读取环境变量 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`，若为 `None`，则打印错误信息并 `sys.exit(78)`。\n3.  **日志证据**：\n    *   `kubectl previous_logs` 和 `query_pod_logs` (ES) 均一致返回：`APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`。\n    *   该错", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789142618112, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

